    {
      "id": "decl-invariants",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "Invariants",
      "position": {
        "x": 380,
        "y": -640
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Invariants",
        "body": "**What makes this thing a Declaration, specifically?**\n\n- Exactly one authoritative Declaration per graph (a fragment may have none; it never has two).\n- Owns `data.identity` — `graphId`, `name`, `version`, `description` — for the graph as a whole.\n- Owns `data.intent` — `kind` and `scope` — stating what kind of artifact this graph is.\n- Is reachable as the graph's implicit root port even when no other node explicitly claims that role.\n- Every other node that belongs to this graph shares its `graphId`.\n\nA View representation is required before each terminal Glyph. Rendering glyph-shaped artwork does not require an icon View classification.",
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
        "definitionKey": "page-section",
        "_classBinding": {
          "key": "page-section",
          "sourceRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/page-template/classes/page-section.node-class.node",
          "ref": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/page-template/classes/page-section.node-class.node",
          "identity": {
            "graphId": "page-section-class",
            "name": "Page Section",
            "version": "0.8.1",
            "description": ""
          },
          "intent": "node-class",
          "meaning": "",
          "description": "",
          "defaults": {
            "label": "Page Section",
            "size": {
              "width": 520,
              "height": 320
            },
            "showLabel": false,
            "ports": [
              {
                "id": "root",
                "key": "root",
                "label": "root",
                "direction": "bidirectional",
                "dataType": "any",
                "angle": 270,
                "position": {
                  "side": "top",
