        "body": "Source (twilite repository):\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/declarationRelationshipHandles.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/systemNodeDefaults.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/graphNavigationAddress.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/validators/validateGraphInvariants.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/Nodes/ManifestNode.js`\n\nFocused tests:\n- `tests/declarationTemplate.test.js`\n- `tests/surfaceChains.test.js`\n- `tests/declarationDefaults.test.js`\n\nStructural tests establish shape and links; they do not establish browser behavior.",
